The project is maintained for internal research and authorized collaboration.
No public open-source license has been granted for project-owned material.
Access to this private repository does not itself grant public redistribution rights.
Third-party components remain subject to their own licenses and terms;
see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md. Unresolved redistribution permissions must be
cleared before any public release. No unpublished paper metadata is asserted.
